        "value": "CC-Zero|Église Saint-Gervais-Saint-Protais de Paris|Images from Paris Musées|Drawings in Musée Carnavalet|Drawings of Paris by Frédéric Houbron|Church tower of Église Saint-Gervais-Saint-Protais",
